{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03884","headline":"孝和皇帝挽歌 · 贾曾","name":"孝和皇帝挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新命千龄啓，鸿图累圣余。\n天行应潜跃，帝出受图书。\n礼若传尧旧，功疑复夏初。\n梦游长不返，何国是华胥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}